claim.claim-text:
1. A gun light that is easy to replace a battery, comprising a housing, a light-emitting module, a seat module, and a fixing mechanism;
the housing is provided with a battery compartment that is penetrated through, and the battery compartment is slidably fitted with a battery module;
one side of the light-emitting module is rotatably connected to one end of the housing, and the other side of the light-emitting module is provided with a light-emitting locking groove; when the light-emitting module seals one end of the battery compartment, the light-emitting module is electrically connected to the battery module;
the seat module is connected to the other end of the housing; when the seat module seals the other end of the battery compartment, the seat module is electrically connected to the battery module;
the fixing mechanism comprises a locking component, and the locking component comprises a locking elastic sheet and a light-emitting locking rod; the locking elastic sheet is fixedly connected to the housing;
when the locking component is locked, one end of the locking elastic sheet is clamped and fixed in the light-emitting locking groove;
the light-emitting locking rod is rotatably provided on the housing and located at a bottom of the locking elastic sheet;
the light-emitting locking rod comprises a light-emitting plane and a light-emitting arc surface.

5. The gun light according to claim 1, wherein one end of the seat module is rotatably connected to the housing, the other end of the seat module is provided with a seat locking groove,
the other end of the locking elastic sheet is penetrated and fixed in the seat locking groove,
the locking component further comprises a seat locking rod, and the seat locking rod is rotatably provided on the housing and located at a bottom of the locking elastic sheet;
the seat locking rod comprises a seat body plane and a seat body arc surface;
when the seat body plane abuts against the locking elastic sheet, one end of the locking elastic sheet is clamped and fixed with the seat locking groove;
when the seat locking rod is rotated and the seat body arc surface abuts against the locking elastic sheet, one end of the locking elastic sheet is disengaged, and is clamped and fixed with the seat locking groove.

10. The gun light according to claim 9, wherein the housing is provided with a limit position slot, and the limit position slot comprises a first limit end and a second limit end,
the first rod body is fixedly provided with a limit protrusion, the limit protrusion is penetrated and slidably fitted to the limit position slot, and when the limit protrusion is penetrated and slidably fitted with the first limit end, the adjusting protrusion is disengaged from the contact protrusions;
when the limit protrusion is slid to the second limit end, the adjusting protrusion is rotated to align with the clamping groove.
